{
  "$comment": "Sprite manifest for Hive agent bees. Each strip is a vertical sheet: frames stacked top-to-bottom, frameWidth x frameHeight per frame. Bee faces 'up' (north); rotate toward travel direction in-engine. Render nearest-neighbor (no smoothing).",
